    "causal_summary": "The retrieval code is correct and its documents are not: the conventions describe a concept lane over an embedded index that does not exist, the search router carries a recipe that drops three mandatory flags, the presentation asset names three of five match classes, the READMEs give test commands over a directory that was moved, and the doctor never performs the one cheap check that would have caught the committed index lagging its manifest",
